            "review_title": "Review at Kintan Dining & Bar Nha Trang",
            "review_text": "Axel Jordan S.\nStavanger, Norway158 contributions\n0\nAmazing & quite authentic!\nJul 2026 • Family\nGreat experience all 3 hours. Got a reservation, and they insisted on putting us on the second floor. It’s very cozy and overall a nice atmosphere.\n\nTheres a great personalised experience here and the staff help you out a great deal, and always are available for requests. They know what they’re doing on all aspects.\n\nThe food is of high quality and straight up melted in your mouth. We had around 3 rounds of meals, all three were great and at a high and a consistant quality. It’s hard for me to remember the last time I had beef this good before. Every bite and condiments fit well together. Additionally their croquetas, scampi, matcha icecream, drinks, etc. were amazing too. Opened and closed with a signature drink, both equally great and unique.\n\nThe value is excellent in comparison to other restaurants in the same league. Our total came up to around 1.6 million Dong per person, which is a very good deal for the quality and service you get. Mind you thats for 3 hours as well.\n\nOverall I highly reccomend this place a lot. Great food, great staff, on the track for something greater if continuing to prestige with excellency as they showed us today.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten July 15, 2026",
            "rating": 4.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-11",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
