            "review_title": "Review at Kintan Dining & Bar Nha Trang",
            "review_text": "K K\n3 contributions\n0\nGreat place, I recommend it!\nMay 2026 • Family\nI wanted to finish the evening off nicely, have a nice dinner. Came into this restaurant by chance, walking by on the street. You weren't wrong! The first thing we were impressed with was the look of the place. Fashionable. Stylish. Careful.\nTasted their specialty, cooked right in front of us at the table. The cuisine is great, the dishes are very beautiful, impressive. The restaurant is very clean, nice to be in. I'd like to mention our beautiful waitress Ngoc Tram (Chum). Nice and nimble, doing just fine. She taught us Vietnamese and we taught her Russian :) \nWe had a very good evening! I'll definitely be there again. I recommend it!\nRead more\nTranslated from Russian\nShow original\nWritten May 16, 2026",
